Repository for springboot demo projects

Steps to install and run kafka server

Step-1: Download and unzip : https://kafka.apache.org/downloads

Step-2 : Set Environmental Variables (HOME nad Path)

Step-3: Edit the properties file:
  i)  zookeeper.peroperties = dataDir=C:/kafka/tmp/zookeeper
  ii) server.properties  = log.dirs=C:/kafka/config/tmp/kafka-logs

Step-4: Start zookeeper 
 .\bin\windows\zookeeper-server-start.bat .\config\zookeeper.properties

Step-5: Start a kafka broker
 .\bin\windows\kafka-server-start.bat .\config\server.properties

Step-6: Check kafka services 
  jps

Step-7: Stop zookeeper 
.\bin\windows\zookeeper-server-stop.bat

Step-8: Stop kafka service 
.\bin\windows\kafka-server-stop.bat